# Sarga
**Quality Printing & Custom Solutions | Established 1994**

Welcome to Sarga! Since our founding in 1994, we have grown from a small offset printing shop into a comprehensive printing, binding, and custom gifting destination. With state-of-the-art machinery spread across our branches in Perambra and MPR, we are fully equipped to handle everything from bulk commercial printing to personalized wedding cards and trophies.

